f 17592186045465 13194139535911 true] [17592186374053 1100 "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned} & 3x+8y=22 \\\\  & 7x-5y=4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form." 13194139535911 true] [17592186374053 1113 #uuid "87c26d6c-3cf0-5b9b-ada3-9bbdd3c94fdc" 13194139535911 true] [17592186374053 1145 "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 8 & 22 \\\\ 7 & -5 & 4\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}3 & 8 & 22 \\\\ 7 & -5 & 4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{3}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 7 & -5 & 4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-7{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 0 & -\\frac{71}{3} & -\\frac{142}{3}\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :=-\\frac{3}{71}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535911 true] [17592186374054 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374055 13194139535911 true] [17592186374054 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374056 13194139535911 true] [17592186374054 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374057 13194139535911 true] [17592186374054 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374058 13194139535911 true] [17592186374054 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374059 13194139535911 true] [17592186374054 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535911 true] [17592186374054 1041 "selection" 13194139535911 true] [17592186374054 1104 #edb/ref 17592186374056 13194139535911 true] [17592186374054 1110 #uuid "e0fa4221-2596-59c8-aef6-c18748848d9f" 13194139535911 true] [17592186374055 1034 "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]" 13194139535911 true] [17592186374055 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535911 true] [17592186374055 1111 #uuid "2a66b23d-f2b7-5b5a-a485-c2924bff3dad" 13194139535911 true] [175921863740